# What `railway up` must not upload.
#
# Deploys from local go through this file, not .dockerignore — the ignore runs
# before the tarball is built, so anything listed here never leaves the machine.
# node_modules alone is 558MB and the image installs its own copy anyway.
# `resources/theology-retrieval/library.sqlite3` is intentionally ignored by
# Git but required by the API image. Local production deploys therefore use
# `railway up --no-gitignore`; the secret patterns below become load-bearing.
node_modules
dist
dist-mobile
dist-electron
release
build
android
ios
mobile
website
assets
*.dmg
*.zip
*.exe
*.blockmap
.git
.env
.env.*
.operator-license-key
.operator-license-key.pub
*-license-key
electron/embedded-key.js
